<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the German Bundesliga after Sunday's game:</p>
<p>8 - Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe)</p>
<p>7 - Ulf Kirsten (Bayer Leverkusen)</p>
<p>6 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen), Jonathan Akpoborie (Hansa Rostock)</p>
<p>5 - Bruno Labbadia (Werder Bremen), Paulo Sergio (Bayer Leverkusen), Bernhard Winkler (1860 Munich), Martin Max (Schalke 04), Fredi Bobic (VfB Stuttgart), Giovane Elber (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
</text>
